<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.13 vs   3.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.48 vs   4.69</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.41 vs  10.85</p>
<p> Sales		  119.27 vs 104.50</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.54 vs   5.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.54 vs   8.00</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.72 vs  14.18</p>
<p> Sales		  272.99 vs 188.69</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader is Rolimpex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
